#. js-lingui-id: HP7per
#: src/modules/applications/utils/getStandardApplicationDescription.ts
msgid ""
"The base data model every Twenty workspace runs on.\n"
"\n"
"#### What \"foundation\" means\n"
"\n"
"Every Twenty workspace starts with this set of objects. They define the shape of your CRM, including relationships, activity, and reporting. Everything else, including marketplace apps, AI agents, and custom objects, plugs into them.\n"
"\n"
"#### Included objects\n"
"- **People & Companies**: contact and account records\n"
"- **Opportunities**: your sales pipeline\n"
"- **Notes & Tasks**: activity and follow-ups\n"
"- **Workflows & Dashboards**: automation and reporting\n"
"\n"
"Remove this app and the rest of Twenty has nothing to hang off.\n"
"\n"
"#### Build your own app\n"
"\n"
"Extend Twenty with your own objects, fields, logic functions, or AI skills. Scaffold a new app in one command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Then inside the folder:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the [Getting Started guide](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/getting-started) for the full walkthrough, and [Building Apps](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/building) for the `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` APIs."
msgstr ""
"Osnovni model podataka na kom radi svaki Twenty radni prostor.\n"
"\n"
"#### Šta znači „osnova”\n"
"\n"
"Svaki Twenty radni prostor počinje sa ovim skupom objekata. Oni definišu oblik vašeg CRM-a, uključujući odnose, aktivnosti i izveštavanje. Sve ostalo, uključujući aplikacije sa marketplejsa, AI agente i prilagođene objekte, priključuje se na njih.\n"
"\n"
"#### Uključeni objekti\n"
"- **Ljudi i kompanije**: zapisi o kontaktima i nalozima\n"
"- **Poslovne prilike**: vaš prodajni levak\n"
"- **Beleške i zadaci**: aktivnosti i praćenja\n"
"- **Radni tokovi i kontrolne table**: automatizacija i izveštavanje\n"
"\n"
"Uklonite ovu aplikaciju i ostatak Twenty neće imati na šta da se nadoveže.\n"
"\n"
"#### Napravite sopstvenu aplikaciju\n"
"\n"
"Proširite Twenty sopstvenim objektima, poljima, logičkim funkcijama ili AI veštinama. Postavite skelet nove aplikacije jednom komandom:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Zatim unutar fascikle:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pogledajte [vodič za početak](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/getting-started) za potpun pregled korak po korak, i [Pravljenje aplikacija](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/building) za `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` API-je."

